==================== Instruction ====================
I want a webpage where I can organize my data in a flexible database. I should be able to add entries with different types of fields like text, numbers, dates, and checkboxes. The page should let me switch between viewing my data as a simple table or as cards in a grid layout. I need basic ways to sort entries by any field and filter them to show only what I'm looking for. All changes should appear immediately as I work.Additional features include a quick search bar and the ability to manually adjust the order of entries in both table and card views (sort states are saved automatically). Furthermore, the selection of field types will restrict the subsequent input formats. Field configuration must be completed before importing data; otherwise, the data cannot be parsed correctly due to format mismatches. Meanwhile, the sorting rules for the table and card views are not shared with each other, and sorting criteria need to be reconfigured after switching views.
